 * features for inventory management and sales analysis.
 *
 * @section features_sec Key Features
 * - User authentication with different roles (Admin/Customer)
 * - Music inventory management
 * - Shopping cart functionality
 * - Order processing and history
 * - Discount voucher system
 * - Sales statistics for administrators
